Flame Strike
Basic: Launches a projectile dealing 2-4 fire damage. The projectile has a 10% chance of burning the target. \nExpert: Two projectiles\nMaster: Three projectiles.
Ice Dart
Basic: Launches a projectile dealing 2-4 cold damage. The projectile has a 10% chance of freezing the target. \nExpert: Two projectiles\nMaster: Three projectiles.
Rock Blast
Basic: Launches a projectile dealing 1-2 earth damage and 1-2 physical damage. The projectile has a 10% chance of grounding the target. \nExpert: Two projectiles\nMaster: Three projectiles.
Static Charge
Basic: Launches a projectile dealing 2-4 electric. The projectile has a 10% chance of shocking the target. \nExpert: Two projectiles\nMaster: Three projectiles.
Leap
Basic: The caster leaps high into the air.\nExpert and Master: Increases the height of the leap.
Mind Probe
Basic: A point-blank mental assault on a target, dealing 8-16 mind damage. \nExpert and Master: Deals 50% more damage.
Prayer
Basic: Reduces damage taken by 20% for one minute.\nExpert and Master: Reduces damage by an additional 20%. 
Resurrection
Basic: Restores a fallen comrade to life.\nExpert: Resurrects players with 25% HP.\nMaster: Resurrects players with 50% HP.
Heal Other
Basic: Restores 2-8 HP to a wounded comrade.\nExpert and Master: Restores 100% more HP.
Heal Self
Basic: Restores 2-8 HP to the caster.\nExpert and Master: Restores 100% more HP.
Wound
Basic: Fires a projectile dealing 1-2 holy damage + 1 physical damage.\nExpert: Two projectiles\nMaster: Three projectiles.
Mana Strike
Basic: Launches a projectile dealing 2-4 energy damage. \nExpert: Two projectiles\nMaster: Three projectiles.
Void Law
Basic: Launches a projectile dealing 1 physical damage. The projectile also drains the target of 1 mana. \nExpert: Two projectiles\nMaster: Three projectiles.
Leap
Basic: The player that steps on this sigil will leap high into the air. \nExpert and Master: Increases the height of the leap.
Curse 
Expert: Causes the target to deal 20% less damage for 15 seconds. Master: Damage debuff is increased by 50%.
