Summon Dead
Summons the spirit of a fallen comrade to the caster.
You've been banished to Valhalla by an enemy cleric!
Banish Spirit
Basic: Sends the spirit of a fallen enemy to Valhalla. \nExpert: Banish restores mana equal to the level of the banished spirit. \nMaster: Banish restores mana equal to twice the level of the banished spirit.
Fireball
Launches a projectile that explodes on impact, dealing 2-4 damage per point of skill to nearby targets. \nBasic: Inflicts 33% splash damage. \nExpert: Inflicts 50% splash damage. \nMaster: Inflicts 67% splash damage.
Firebolt
Shoots a bolt of flame, dealing 1-4 damage per point of skill. 
Firestorm
Causes the target to be engulfed in an explosive, fiery tempest.
Proximity Heal
Heals the caster and any nearby friendly players.
Shock Nova
The caster rapidly discharges a burst of electrical dealing damage to adjacent enemies.
Smite
Fires a magically-conjured weapon at an enemy target. 
Stonebolt
Shoots a bolt of stone, dealing 1-4 damage per point of skill. 
Fire Shield
Increases the caster's resistance against fire-based attacks.
Ice Shield
Increases the caster's resistance against ice-based attacks.
Electric Shield
Increases the caster's resistance against electric-based attacks.
Earth Shield
Increases the caster's resistance against earth-based attacks.
Airwall
Conjures a wall of air in front of the caster.
Manawall
Conjures a wall of mana in front of the caster.
